{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1383816181476830", "organization": {"id": "1021871844337934", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "1430902360101545"}]}, "id": "1907839910596977"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "1383816181476830"}]}, "id": "1672840674261309"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "1383816181476830", "release_date": 1791387360, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1488408977684216"}, "id": "1488129260039176"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1795134702, "id": "1488403164351464", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v8", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 5, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "1488310864360694"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "1383816181476830"}, "id": "1488310864360694", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "PENDING", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": null, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604347072_2335297387244690_3701385173439912652_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FmRBLBK3F34Q7kNvwG2ILKj&_nc_oc=Ado4rbtwgueNANatYsEWKtXlY6TKbd1tWcFTExbIkNfRjEBDwQ6Ae876t3LZnR2eDLM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSVJ_O5-lCY8dZnERoBFtbu9mmwYPxGSRQ8Jkg2piKvhQ&oe=6B05C763"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "SudokuPlus", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Puzzle", "id": "377978390272490"}], "release_date": 1791387360, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "1383816198143495", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "1383816181476830", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "2953377995021056"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2579024369264038", "locale": "pt_PT", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "SudokuPlus", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Um desafio conhecido. Uma experi\u00eancia nas tuas m\u00e3os.\n\nO SudokuPlus traz o Sudoku para o espa\u00e7o virtual. Aproxima a m\u00e3o de um n\u00famero, faz pin\u00e7a para o agarrar e coloca-o no quadro com o rastreio de m\u00e3os do Meta Quest. Podes tamb\u00e9m usar um raio de intera\u00e7\u00e3o opcional.\n\nQUATRO FORMAS DE JOGAR\nEscolhe Normal, Double ou Samurai de cinco quadros, com tr\u00eas dificuldades. Explora o Astral: mapas conectados com zonas Samurai, grelhas maiores e dificuldades variadas. O progresso fica guardado entre zonas. Completa um mapa para desbloquear o seguinte.\n\nAJUSTA AO TEU CONFORTO\nMove toda a esta\u00e7\u00e3o de jogo para ajustar a posi\u00e7\u00e3o. Escolhe o espa\u00e7o real \u00e0 tua volta ou um ambiente de cl\u00ednica, jardim ou social. Interface em portugu\u00eas e ingl\u00eas.\n\nVALIDA E CONTINUA\nUm toque valida os n\u00fameros colocados. O segundo devolve todas as pe\u00e7as erradas em conjunto, mantendo as certas. Os c\u00f3digos de partida e rankings locais de tempo distinguem desafios e modos de intera\u00e7\u00e3o equivalentes.\n\nRESUMOS PRIVADOS DE ATIVIDADE\nO hist\u00f3rico de movimentos \u00e9 opcional e vem desligado. Adultos confirmados pela Meta podem ativar resumos locais de utiliza\u00e7\u00e3o das m\u00e3os, encaixes e movimento. S\u00e3o estimativas do jogo, n\u00e3o medi\u00e7\u00f5es cl\u00ednicas certificadas, diagn\u00f3stico ou tratamento.\n\nCompra \u00fanica. Todas as ajudas de valida\u00e7\u00e3o inclu\u00eddas. Sem compras na aplica\u00e7\u00e3o.\n\nCriado por Reisioval.", "short_description": "Traz o Sudoku para o teu espa\u00e7o com o rastreio de m\u00e3os do Meta Quest. Joga Normal, Double, Samurai ou mapas Astral conectados. Ajusta a posi\u00e7\u00e3o, guarda o progresso e explora novos desafios com rankings locais e resumos de atividade."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE.png", "id": "2335297383911357", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604347072_2335297387244690_3701385173439912652_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FmRBLBK3F34Q7kNvwG2ILKj&_nc_oc=Ado4rbtwgueNANatYsEWKtXlY6TKbd1tWcFTExbIkNfRjEBDwQ6Ae876t3LZnR2eDLM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRkb1z5NDHwC5cKlnMwsr4psdUqDboNB2j5F_UYytYRcA&oe=6B05C763"}, {"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE.png", "id": "1919378609033004", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673652249_1919378612366337_244491657219048585_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MLU5VDgMcHEQ7kNvwHwqORD&_nc_oc=Ado6sgYOfsQ5LKMSnPLZ8f2y8SdEBT8JTyTIa7C8I-o3PnJdLA2Q7aFLtedRU-sBIe4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSWm4kd_tK3mpXsXlaHX1YR1ItWnFMzf4839k_taCZouA&oe=6B05D629"}, {"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT.png", "id": "1435022458592775", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830904_1435022461926108_1622760096169246812_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_oh